    "updated_at": "2019-04-05T13:32:24Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure it's that simple. E.g., [replace all](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-replace-all) can be passed a `ShadowRoot` and will adopt, from what I can tell. It will end up empty too, but still probably not what we want?\r\n\r\nI think the problem is with `DocumentFragment`'s host is that we only tried to prevent truly broken cases and did not analyze other side effects enough.",
