    "body": "If I insert a node that has an attached `ShadowRoot` into a different document, it wouldn't be adopted? I suspect you didn't mean to say that.\r\n\r\nI suppose what we need to do is that when you adopt a node that has a host, that needs to be handled in a special way. But if you hit such a node due to recursion, that should not be handled in a special way.",
