    "body": "I don't follow. `adoptNode()` throws on `ShadowRoot`. It's the other places that are potentially problematic.\r\n\r\nWe can use assertions and you are free to add them via PRs (or request them to be added during review of a PR): https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assertions.",
